      "start": 18.462,
      "end": 22.25,
      "page": 1
    },
    {
      "order": 6,
      "text_en": "\"Little pig, little pig, let me come in!\"",
      "text_ko": "\"아기 돼지야, 나 좀 들어가게 해줘!\"",
      "start": 22.25,
      "end": 26.5,
      "page": 1
    },
    {
      "order": 7,
      "text_en": "Pig One says, \"No, no, no! Not by the hair on my chinny chin chin!\"",
      "text_ko": "첫째 돼지가 말해요. \"안 돼, 안 돼, 안 돼! 내 턱수염 걸고 절대 안 돼!\"",
      "start": 26.5,
      "end": 34.15,
      "page": 1
    },
    {
      "order": 8,
      "text_en": "The wolf huffs and he puffs.",
